@startuml er-conversations
' Propósito: modelo relacional del módulo conversations (5 entidades): ChannelAccount + Conversation + Message + MessageAttachment + ConversationAssignmentLog. Pipe de mensajería multicanal (WhatsApp en el MVP).
' Última actualización: 2026-06-02 (modelo final spec §2: +phone_number_id; channel_type = reuse crm.ChannelType (sin FK); bot_configuration_id/default_campaign_id = FK forward sin constraint ADR-009; FK aditiva lead_activity.related_conversation_id → conversation)
' Código de referencia: backend/app/modules/conversations/models/

!theme plain
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 55
skinparam ranksep 70
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
hide circle
hide empty members

title ER — Backend · Conversations module

legend top right
  | <#FFFFE0> Marker | Significado |
  | * | NOT NULL |
  | <<PK>> | Primary Key |
  | <<FK>> | Foreign Key (constraint física) |
  | <<unique>> | UNIQUE constraint |
  | <<nullable>> | NULL permitido |
  | <<fwd>> | FK forward diferida — columna sin FK física (ADR-009) |
endlegend

' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Cuenta de canal (config externa + ref al secreto)
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
entity "channel_account" as t_ca {
  * id : varchar(36) <<PK>>
  --
  * channel_type : varchar(40)   ' slug de crm.ChannelType (reuse, NO FK)
  * name : varchar(120)
  * external_identifier : varchar(255)
  secret_name : varchar(255) <<nullable>>
  webhook_verify_token : varchar(255) <<nullable>>
  phone_number_id : varchar(64) <<nullable>>
  bot_configuration_id : varchar(36) <<nullable, fwd→bot_configuration>>
  default_campaign_id : varchar(36) <<nullable, fwd→campaign>>
  --
  ' UNIQUE PARCIAL (channel_type, external_identifier) WHERE deleted_at IS NULL
  '   (dialect-agnóstico: postgresql_where + sqlite_where)
  '   Violación → CHANNEL_ACCOUNT_EXTERNAL_TAKEN (409)
  * active : boolean
  deleted_at : timestamptz <<nullable>>
  * created_on : timestamptz
  * created_by : varchar(36)
  * updated_on : timestamptz
  * updated_by : varchar(36)
}

' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Conversation (hilo entre Person y ChannelAccount)
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
entity "conversation" as t_conv {
  * id : varchar(36) <<PK>>
  --
  * channel_account_id : varchar(36) <<FK→channel_account>>
  person_id : varchar(36) <<nullable, FK→person>>
  * status : varchar(20)        ' open / closed
  * assignee_type : varchar(20) ' bot / advisor / unassigned
  assignee_user_id : varchar(36) <<nullable, FK→user>>
  bot_configuration_id : varchar(36) <<nullable, fwd→bot_configuration>>
  * opened_at : timestamptz
  closed_at : timestamptz <<nullable>>
  last_message_at : timestamptz <<nullable>>
  last_message_preview : varchar(255) <<nullable>>
  * unread_count : int = 0
  --
  ' UNIQUE PARCIAL (person_id, channel_account_id)
  '   WHERE status='open' AND deleted_at IS NULL  (una sola open por par)
  ' Invariantes (validados en service, code propio):
  '   assignee_type='advisor'    ⇒ assignee_user_id NOT NULL (sino INVALID_ASSIGNEE 400)
  '   assignee_type ∈ {bot, unassigned} ⇒ assignee_user_id IS NULL
  '   assignee_type='bot'        ⇒ bot_configuration_id NOT NULL (no aplica en MVP)
  '   cerrar (closed)            ⇒ cierra el log vigente (ended_at=now)
  '   cambio de assignee         ⇒ cierra log vigente + abre uno nuevo (misma tx)
  * active : boolean
  deleted_at : timestamptz <<nullable>>
  * created_on : timestamptz
  * created_by : varchar(36)
  * updated_on : timestamptz
  * updated_by : varchar(36)
}

' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Mensaje individual (audit inmutable — SIN SoftDelete)
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
entity "message" as t_msg {
  * id : varchar(36) <<PK>>
  --
  * conversation_id : varchar(36) <<FK→conversation>>
  * direction : varchar(10)         ' inbound / outbound
  * sender_type : varchar(20)       ' contact / bot / advisor / system
  sender_user_id : varchar(36) <<nullable, FK→user>>
  bot_configuration_id : varchar(36) <<nullable, fwd→bot_configuration>>
  * content_type : varchar(20)      ' text / image / audio / ... / system_notification
  content : text <<nullable>>
  external_id : varchar(255) <<nullable>>
  external_status : varchar(40) <<nullable>>
  * sent_at : timestamptz
  delivered_at : timestamptz <<nullable>>
  read_at : timestamptz <<nullable>>
  failed_at : timestamptz <<nullable>>
  failure_reason : varchar(255) <<nullable>>
  provider_payload : jsonb <<nullable>>
  --
  ' UNIQUE PARCIAL (conversation_id, external_id)
  '   WHERE external_id IS NOT NULL — idempotencia ante reenvío de webhook
  ' SIN SoftDelete — mensajes inmutables (audit)
  * active : boolean
  * created_on : timestamptz
  * created_by : varchar(36)
  * updated_on : timestamptz
  * updated_by : varchar(36)
}

' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Adjuntos (1:N desde Message) — SIN SoftDelete; processing diferido (F4)
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
entity "message_attachment" as t_att {
  * id : varchar(36) <<PK>>
  --
  * message_id : varchar(36) <<FK→message>>
  * attachment_type : varchar(20)   ' image / audio / video / document / location / sticker / contact_card
  url : varchar(1000) <<nullable>>
  mime_type : varchar(100) <<nullable>>
  size_bytes : int <<nullable>>
  duration_sec : int <<nullable>>
  latitude : numeric(9,6) <<nullable>>
  longitude : numeric(9,6) <<nullable>>
  address_label : varchar(255) <<nullable>>
  original_filename : varchar(255) <<nullable>>
  external_media_id : varchar(255) <<nullable>>
  metadata : jsonb <<nullable>>
  --
  ' SIN SoftDelete — coherente con Message
  ' Modelado desde el inicio; el processor F2/F3 NO la puebla (texto-primero; F4 cablea media)
  * active : boolean
  * created_on : timestamptz
  * created_by : varchar(36)
  * updated_on : timestamptz
  * updated_by : varchar(36)
}

' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Historial de handoff (inmutable — SIN SoftDelete)
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
entity "conversation_assignment_log" as t_log {
  * id : varchar(36) <<PK>>
  --
  * conversation_id : varchar(36) <<FK→conversation>>
  from_assignee_type : varchar(20) <<nullable>>
  from_assignee_user_id : varchar(36) <<nullable, FK→user>>
  * to_assignee_type : varchar(20)
  to_assignee_user_id : varchar(36) <<nullable, FK→user>>
  * started_at : timestamptz
  ended_at : timestamptz <<nullable>>
  by_actor_user_id : varchar(36) <<nullable, FK→user>>
  reason : varchar(255) <<nullable>>
  --
  ' SIN SoftDelete — audit trail inmutable
  * active : boolean
  * created_on : timestamptz
  * created_by : varchar(36)
  * updated_on : timestamptz
  * updated_by : varchar(36)
}

' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Entidades externas
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
entity "person" as t_per <<external>> #lightgrey {
  ' Módulo: crm
  * id : varchar(36) <<PK>>
  ...
}
entity "user" as t_user <<external>> #lightgrey {
  ' Módulo: admin
  * id : varchar(36) <<PK>>
  ...
}
entity "lead_activity" as t_act <<external>> #lightgrey {
  ' Módulo: crm — conversations le agrega la FK aditiva
  * id : varchar(36) <<PK>>
  * person_id : varchar(36) <<FK→person>>
  related_conversation_id : varchar(36) <<nullable, FK aditiva→conversation>>
  ...
}
entity "bot_configuration" as t_bot <<external>> #lightgrey {
  ' Módulo: bots (#6, NO existe) — FK forward, hoy NULL
  * id : varchar(36) <<PK>>
  ...
}
entity "campaign" as t_camp <<external>> #lightgrey {
  ' Módulo: marketing (#8, NO existe) — FK forward, hoy NULL
  * id : varchar(36) <<PK>>
  ...
}

' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Relaciones
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

' ChannelAccount → Conversation
t_ca ||--o{ t_conv : "abre\nconversaciones"

' Conversation → Person (opcional, casi siempre poblado)
t_per |o--o{ t_conv : "person_id\n(opcional al inicio)"

' Conversation → User (assignee opcional)
t_user |o--o{ t_conv : "assignee\n(opcional)"

' Conversation → BotConfiguration (forward, opcional)
t_bot |o..o{ t_conv : "bot efectivo\n(fwd, opcional)"

' ChannelAccount → BotConfiguration (default, forward)
t_bot |o..o{ t_ca : "bot default\n(fwd, opcional)"

' ChannelAccount → Campaign (atribución, forward)
t_camp |o..o{ t_ca : "campaña\nde origen (fwd)"

' Conversation → Message
t_conv ||--o{ t_msg : "mensajes"

' Message → MessageAttachment
t_msg ||--o{ t_att : "adjuntos"

' Message → User (sender opcional)
t_user |o--o{ t_msg : "sender\n(si advisor)"

' Message → BotConfiguration (sender forward, opcional)
t_bot |o..o{ t_msg : "sender bot\n(fwd, si bot)"

' Conversation → ConversationAssignmentLog
t_conv ||--o{ t_log : "historial\nhandoffs"

' Log → User (from/to/by, todos opcionales)
t_user |o--o{ t_log : "from/to/by\n(opcionales)"

' Conversation → lead_activity (FK ADITIVA — conversations la agrega, ADR-009)
t_conv ||--o{ t_act : "related_conversation_id\n(FK aditiva)"

' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
' Notas
' ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

note right of t_ca
  **Cuenta de canal (multi-cuenta)**
  Un nro de WhatsApp Business = una fila;
  una clínica puede tener N números sin
  redeploy.

  ""channel_type"" REUSA el enum
  ""crm.ChannelType"" (single source of truth,
  NO se duplica, NO es FK física).

  ""secret_name"" apunta a GCP Secret Manager —
  el ""secret_resolver"" (app.core.secrets, SDK
  runtime + cache TTL) resuelve el token; el
  valor NUNCA vive en BD ni viaja al schema.
  NULL = fallback a env (local/dev). ADR-010.

  ""phone_number_id"" arma la URL de envío de
  Meta ""/{phone_number_id}/messages"".
end note

note right of t_conv
  **Una sola conversation OPEN
  por (person, channel_account)**
  vía UNIQUE PARCIAL sobre status='open'
  AND deleted_at IS NULL. Múltiples cerradas
  pueden coexistir como historial; reabrir
  valida no-otra-open (CONVERSATION_ALREADY_OPEN 409).

  ""assignee_type"" + ""assignee_user_id"" +
  ""bot_configuration_id"" determinan quién
  atiende ahora. Conversación nueva = AUTO al
  dueño del lead (advisor_map de crm), fallback
  ""unassigned"" (bandeja compartida).
end note

note bottom of t_msg
  **Idempotencia webhook**
  UNIQUE PARCIAL (conversation_id, external_id)
  WHERE external_id IS NOT NULL.
  Si Meta reenvía el mismo ""wamid"",
  el INSERT falla y se ignora (dedup).

  SIN SoftDelete — los mensajes son
  audit trail inmutable. ""provider_payload""
  guarda el JSON original (debug; JSONB en
  Postgres, JSON en sqlite/create_all).
end note

note bottom of t_att
  **Estructurado, no solo JSONB**
  Permite reportes ("audios enviados este
  mes") sin parsear payload. Modelado en F2,
  ""url""/storage se cablea en F4 (texto-primero;
  lazy proxy vs GCS se re-confirma en F4).
end note

note right of t_log
  **Cada handoff cierra el log previo
  (ended_at = now()) y abre uno nuevo**
  ""by_actor_user_id"" NULL = automático
  (auto-asignación / sistema).
  Tomar/Liberar emiten CONVERSATION_TAKEN /
  CONVERSATION_RELEASED a crm.lead_activity
  (NO MESSAGE_SENT por-mensaje).
  Inmutable: audit trail.
end note

note bottom of t_act
  **FK ADITIVA — conversations la agrega (ADR-009)**
  La columna ""related_conversation_id"" ya existe
  en ""crm.lead_activity"" (varchar(36)+index, SIN
  constraint). conversations agrega la FK física
  ADITIVA en su migración de threads (F2),
  Postgres-only; NO agrega ""relationship"" ORM
  (modelo crm intacto). Seguro: todos los valores
  actuales son NULL. (caveat: el ALTER ADD FK no
  corre en sqlite/create_all.)
end note

note as N_FWD
  **FKs forward diferidas (ADR-009)** — ""<<fwd>>""
  Columnas ""varchar(36)"" nullable SIN FK física ni
  ""relationship"" — ""bots""(#6) y ""marketing""(#8) aún
  NO existen (declarar el ForeignKey rompería la
  migración; el relationship rompería el mapper).
  Hoy son SIEMPRE NULL. El módulo dueño agrega la
  constraint ADITIVA al crear su tabla:
  • ""channel_account.bot_configuration_id"" → bots.bot_configuration
  • ""conversation.bot_configuration_id""    → bots.bot_configuration
  • ""message.bot_configuration_id""         → bots.bot_configuration
  • ""channel_account.default_campaign_id""  → marketing.campaign
end note
N_FWD .. t_ca
N_FWD .. t_bot

@enduml
